meta {
  name: Get Platform Financial Analytics
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Platform Financial Analytics
  Fetch aggregate incubator performance metrics formatted in Indian Rupees (INR ₹).

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - Analytics object with INR totals and trends returned.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  {
    "currency": "INR",
    "locale": "en-IN",
    "totalFundingRaisedINR": 125000000,
    "averageValuationINR": 35000000,
    "cohortsActive": 6,
    "monthlyGrowthPercent": 18.4
  }
  ```
}
